        "severity": {
          "text": "Mild to moderate"
        },
        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Duration less than six months; clearly linked to breakup and housing/financial stress. Functioning preserved and mood reactive, without pervasive anhedonia. Does not meet criteria for major depressive disorder at this stage."
