          "text": "Sleep symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Sleep remains patchy, with approximately 3–4 bad nights per week. Takes up to 2–3 hours to fall asleep on bad nights, wakes at 4–5 am, and feels unrefreshed. Slight improvement since the last visit after trying breathing exercises and some routine."
      }
